<LearningJourney practical/><ProductPossibilities/>
<div id="book-offer"><StarterOffer location="starter-guide"/></div>
<section class="container story-sample"><div><p class="eyebrow">TAKE A LOOK BEFORE YOU BUY · <LowPolyEmoji name="book" size={30}/></p><h2>Start with a real chapter.</h2><p>Read “Finding Your Winning Topic” from the guide. Use it to consider who your idea helps and what problem it solves, then decide whether you want the full book.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/samples/dont-do-anything/">Open the free sample chapter →</a></section>
